account_statement_enable_banking
================================

Enable Banking synchronization for Tryton: bank authorization, encrypted
sessions, API downloads and scheduled synchronization.

Shared statement management, reconciliation suggestions and accounting
assistants are provided by the account_statement_common dependency.

Set the journal's Synchronization Provider to Enable Banking. Its synchronization
methods ignore journals assigned to another provider. Existing configured journals
are migrated when the provider selector is first installed.

Upgrade
-------

Deploy account_statement_common together with this module, refresh the module
list, activate account_statement_common and upgrade account_statement_enable_banking
in the same activation/upgrade operation. The new dependency migrates
the shared records while preserving their database IDs. See
account_statement_common/doc/index.rst for the migration and connector contract.

